{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方新界南特遣隊今日凌晨起在三號幹線、龍翔道一帶用無人機執法打擊交通違例。其間截查一輛切雙白線的七人車，結果揭發司機涉及藏毒拘捕帶署。</p><figure><img alt=\"男司機在警車上接受調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167038456589717504856147.jpeg/rNcurudhiHsclL-EFdL5Ceo8unhd-X-fl-O0vJfjtLw\"/><figcaption>男司機在警車上接受調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><p>今日（20日）早上8時43分，警方在清麗苑附近停車場外，截停一輛往沙田方向的七人車。警員甫打開車窗，已經嗅到一股大麻煙草味，懷疑車上藏有毒品，正安排司機進行測試，並召緝毒犬到場搜索。據了解，警方在車上撿獲「偉哥」及大麻。</p><figure><img alt=\"緝毒犬在場搜證。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167063354183782400805249.jpeg/CfFIsV13lDj6Jcz2ov41DpASLTH32cNHgsIgDILCIAw\"/><figcaption>緝毒犬在場搜證。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"緝毒犬在場搜證。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167047513342087168197820.jpeg/aNLjn9MA_PpP1yHb9_KJQvp6nGTNxp2OQylKC0MpSgs\"/><figcaption>緝毒犬在場搜證。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在緝毒犬協助下在場搜證。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167047173372776448741258.jpeg/zOLYe-z-zyvwhrpJRFuBJ2TWpk8W-Qa1GQGp9hkBqfY\"/><figcaption>警員在緝毒犬協助下在場搜證。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事私家車懷疑藏有大麻。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167032536438804480569028.jpeg/xZ2qcJEJDMvmMqvuBkx5CJ6UT0-xJXOQPR58bhgefG4\"/><figcaption>涉事私家車懷疑藏有大麻。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"七人車傳出一股大麻煙草味。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167035355132596224018526.jpeg/ge7LvNQhXCB41FIKDZSqzNGwqnSt1xj1SUbMtGxGzLQ\"/><figcaption>七人車傳出一股大麻煙草味。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"七人車傳出一股大麻煙草味。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167035357737390080275493.jpeg/RzXEhXijeLc58eu9KGCTe6EoP_uD6qselhGorLMRqKw\"/><figcaption>七人車傳出一股大麻煙草味。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事私家車懷疑藏有大麻煙草。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167030849112641536348251.jpeg/qDFVzAIKSzG06K2-hAqEXb-uRhsA0x_O7M2i1MnNotQ\"/><figcaption>涉事私家車懷疑藏有大麻煙草。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"行動期間警員截停車輛調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167030841189208064176034.jpeg/clixOIUQT5bymyoixsUHHMQZ1fBD5lJhAZgBbCSYAWw\"/><figcaption>行動期間警員截停車輛調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方使用無人機執法打擊交通違例。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167030831932248064763821.jpeg/-0912OTjapD5FYehCyyb7A-llJwXixsS38g-nfrIPp0\"/><figcaption>警方使用無人機執法打擊交通違例。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方使用無人機執法打擊交通違例。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167030837942685696479826.jpeg/aWP2i9V5xhmw_JgGzxzj7RZxoYBHDakI1tsG8vPbBvI\"/><figcaption>警方使用無人機執法打擊交通違例。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T03:20:22.663502+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":394,"images":11,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}